  "description": "This library is designed to avoid throwing exceptions in the code. Instead, it returns a result from the method and describes the error. The library helps reduce the number of try-catch blocks in the code and is less taxing on the program compared to catching and rethrowing exceptions.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
