  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "V:9.0.1\nWe've updated your library for improved reliability! The HasValue property is now deprecated; please use IsSuccess instead. IsSuccess logic is updated: it's now true only when Value is not null, ensuring its availability. Also, the Result class has been renamed to Return for better clarity in representing method outcomes. The implicit Return to bool conversion is deprecated too; check status using IsSuccess or IsFailure to always access error details. These changes make your code more predictable and safer.",
